## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gargoyle Dungeons
## Notes: A dungeon journal for WoW Forever in the Gargoyle window: every dungeon and raid's bosses, loot and abilities, their quests and quest chains, and a map of where they are, with the drops that are upgrades for your character marked. Needs the Gargoyle addon. Turn it on or off in Options > AddOns > Gargoyle.
## Author: Gargoyle
## Version: 1.0.0
## Dependencies: Gargoyle
